{"id":"u-1bf99960-e9f3-4611-a447-f2132500bcf5","src":"community","title":"MMA Strength and Stability","author":"Jesse E.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/dzHZJC-mma-strength-and-conditioning","desc":"This is an intermediate program to be used 4 days a week. All the days will have a main focus with a super set of an noncomplementary muscle group. The goal of these workouts is to be no longer than an hour and a half a day. \n\nDay one is used for stability. This focuses on strengthening you're base and mid section. \n\nDay two is for pushing and framing. The chest, triceps and shoulders will be the main activated groups. \n\nDay three is for pulling motions. Your back and bi's will be the main targets.\n\nDay four is all about stability and remaining agile while your body is gaining muscle mass. \n\nThis program will assist in making you muscle more dense while not adding muscle size. Keeping the reps in the 10-15 range while adding super sets to allow for muscle fatigue sooner than expected.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Athletics"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":13,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-06-08T17:31:11.292Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Stability","Press","Power","Stability"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Zercher Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":6,"x":4}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":4}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Farmer's Walk (Weighted)","sets":[{"amrap":1,"x":4}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":4}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Lateral Med Ball Slam","sets":[{"r":20,"x":3}]},{"n":"Landmine Twist","sets":[{"r":20,"x":3}]}]},{"n":"Russian Twist","sets":[{"amrap":1,"x":4}]}]},{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Landmine Press","sets":[{"r":20,"x":4}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Skull Crusher","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Floor Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":4}]},{"n":"One Arm Later